### Authority searches for local consignments
POST {{RUUTER_URL}}/efti/api/v1/authority/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: 073b32bc-a081-11f1-8d67-3c9c0f2eb459

{
  "mainTransportId": {"operator": "EQ", "id": "VESSEL-001"}
}

